# Session invariants

A new chat has no prior transcript. These still apply.

1. **Copyright** — Never commit PHB / setting-book prose into seed or GitHub, and never commit unapproved card art (`local-available-card-art.json`, PHB/setting PNGs, new Kibbles or Mage Hand Press portraits). Wiring without book text is fine. See `AGENTS.md` and `docs/repository-overview.md`.

2. **Common modifiers** — Reuse or extend the shared catalog so users can edit wiring in the Compendium. Do not hard-code class/feature names in sheet/runtime when a modifier type exists. Before you add a modifier type, a play-state field, or an `if (name === "…")` branch, read `docs/custom-modifiers.md` — it is the inventory, the known-gap list, and the add-type checklist. Pick which system to author in with `docs/modifier-vs-feature-effect.md`.

3. **Import loop** — If the bug was a Drive JSON / BYO / detect / enrichment lapse, update those plus a regression test. Do not only patch one character. See `docs/homebrew-import-review.md` and `lib/import/modifier-wiring-registry.ts`.
